====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|obsolete|transitive}} To make a sudden movement with, to [[jerk]].
# {{lb|en|archaic|intransitive}} To [[start]] into motion.
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To weave together, [[intertwine]] (strands of [[fiber]]s, [[ribbon]]s, etc.); to arrange (hair) in braids.
#* {{RQ:Milton Paradise Regained|text='''Braid''' your locks with rosy twine.}}
# To mix, or make uniformly soft, by beating, rubbing, or straining, as in preparing food.
# {{lb|en|obsolete}} To [[reproach]]; to [[upbraid]].
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Pericles|I|I|10|passage=Great King, / Few loue to heare the ſinnes they loue to act, / T'would '''brayde''' your ſelfe too neare for me to tell it {{...}}}}

